@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Registered User" as User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Path Service" as PS
database "Path DB" as DB

User -> App : Taps on a specific Path Segment
activate App

App -> Gateway : GET /api/v1/paths/{pathId}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> PS : Forward Request
activate PS

PS -> DB : SELECT status, obstacle_list, avg_speed\nFROM Path_Details WHERE path_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> PS : Return Details
deactivate DB

PS --> Gateway : 200 OK\n{ "status": "...", "potholes": [...], "avgSpeed": ... }
deactivate PS

Gateway --> App : Return JSON
deactivate Gateway

App --> User : Display Path Information
deactivate App

@enduml